The host is not responding. Check:
• the code or address is typed correctly and the room is still open;
• Windows asked the host to «Allow access» for the game: press «Allow» (or add the game to the firewall);
• over the internet the game tries to «punch through» the router by itself; if it fails (someone has mobile internet or a strict router), the host should open port %d UDP (UPnP or manually) or change the port when creating the room;
• if nothing helps, both run Radmin VPN or ZeroTier: the room will appear in the list like on home Wi-Fi.
